  "instructions": [
    "heat the flaxseed oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "add the garlic and ginger and sauté until fragrant.",
    "add the bitter leaf greens and cook until wilted.",
    "mix in the sweet potato, sugar, salt, and sesame oil.",
    "add the kombu seaweed and matcha powder, and stir well.",
    "form the mixture into patties and coat with all-purpose flour.",
    "fry the patties in a pan with a little oil until golden brown and crispy.",
    "serve hot and enjoy!"
